			"widgets_values":[
				"0–3s\nHigh-angle panoramic shot, 2D-3D style, sweet cool pink-white with neon pink-purple lighting. In a girl group practice room with black metal frames and cold white top light, five girls stand in triangle formation, wearing pink stage costumes and platform boots, hands on hips, looking forward with sharp, cool expressions. Camera slowly pushes in, focusing on their synchronized boot stomps on the reflective floor. Electronic dance music begins, creating a powerful opening atmosphere.\n3–8s\nSudden low-angle fast forward shot, cel-shading & 3D render style with magenta neon light. The group performs synchronized head flips and kicks in rhythm. Pink skirts and hairbands swing. The center girl makes a heart gesture then quickly points to the camera. 360° rotating camera with 0.2s quick cuts: cool blonde girl, sharp center girl with glasses, contrasting short brown-haired girl, kicking light blonde braided girl, pink-haired girl with wrist flowers. Motion blur strengthens crisp movements.\n8–12s\nCamera pulls back in 1.5x slow motion, Japanese idol animation style, bright pink and silver contrast. The group changes from triangle to line formation, doing synchronized hand-over-eyes and flick-away moves. Butterfly decorations on outfits shine. Camera slides left to right with slow close-ups. Editing follows motion inertia. Sound: heavy EDM beats, clear footsteps and group chants.\n12–15s\nFast camera movement, 2D realistic hybrid style, back to sweet cool pink-white tone. The group strikes ending pose: one knee down, one hand on the ground, one hand pointing like a gun forward. Hair and skirts still sway naturally.",
